{"skill":{"slug":"ui-ux-design","displayName":"UI/UX Design Guide"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770306205964,"changelog":"Initial release: Complete UI/UX design guide for modern web apps. Includes mobile-first responsive design, color systems, typography, Tailwind CSS + Shadcn/ui patterns, accessibility (WCAG 2.2), micro-interactions, and layout patterns.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":5083,"sha256":"0c82b02d6f71511db1f0f9f65b6955ea7056620125cfb647cdd87de6e2d4c8a7","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"UI_UX_MASTER_GUIDE.md","size":12054,"sha256":"f513c52de604b834ab8b9ebab7de3ac46912d5f2f4726f13019f8feb284a6c64","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/ACCESSIBILITY.md","size":12737,"sha256":"04381f98214f674c27b2e4b78c874308d5f85fd777437a7296cb6dccfe3e76ef","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/COMPONENTS.md","size":12402,"sha256":"1fde0b368e45ea75cabe460fd6969183523ff6157f517e1be155b607015b68af","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md","size":12054,"sha256":"f513c52de604b834ab8b9ebab7de3ac46912d5f2f4726f13019f8feb284a6c64","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2267,"sha256":"690d8e5d7b7c8c6bde2ebc8364ca4cdb9c2c2ae56569cc15c0636aa4d90ae173","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789035166156,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"fa97392a8963d55ae853a0f5d63f9fb94eaf50c1517693287a84ca492f7e47c8","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/fa97392a8963d55ae853a0f5d63f9fb94eaf50c1517693287a84ca492f7e47c8","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: \nDeveloper: \nVersion: \nDescription: OpenClaw Agent Skill\n\nThe skill bundle is benign. It provides comprehensive UI/UX design principles, patterns, and setup instructions. The `SKILL.md` and `UI_UX_MASTER_GUIDE.md` files contain standard `npx` commands for setting up Next.js projects with Tailwind CSS and Shadcn/ui (`npx create-next-app`, `npx shadcn@latest init`, `npx shadcn@latest add`). These commands are directly aligned with the stated purpose of the skill to assist with UI/UX design and project setup, and do not exhibit any malicious intent, data exfiltration, persistence, or prompt injection attempts beyond the skill's legitimate function. All referenced external tools and resources are legitimate design and development utilities.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779161599571},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":16,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":18,"checkedAt":1789035166156},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a UI/UX guidance skill with expected setup examples, but users should treat its unpinned npm commands cautiously.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Running the documented scaffolding commands would execute third-party npm CLI code with the invoking user's normal project permissions; this is common for the stated stack but should be done in an isolated development context.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The guide includes explicit user-run setup commands using npx create-next-app@latest and npx shadcn@latest, which are purpose-aligned but mutable and not reproducible.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions stay within design and frontend implementation guidance and do not attempt to override agent policies, capture secrets, alter memory, or perform unrelated actions.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package contains markdown guidance only, file modes are non-executable, and I found no background workers, persistence hooks, privilege escalation, credential handling, or destructive commands.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifacts coherently provide UI/UX, accessibility, responsive design, Tailwind, and Shadcn/ui guidance for building interfaces.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing or following this skill, treat the npx examples as convenience commands rather than vetted build steps. Prefer pinning exact create-next-app and shadcn versions, running scaffolding in a clean project or container, and avoiding production credentials or sensitive environment variables during setup.","findings":"[RP1] expected: The reported unpinned npx examples are present in the skill and reference guide; they are standard frontend scaffolding instructions, not hidden payload retrieval or automatic execution by the skill.\n[T08] expected: The static dependency warning is valid as supply-chain hygiene guidance because @latest can change over time, but the behavior is disclosed, user-directed, and aligned with setting up the named UI stack.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789035166156}}}}}